{"title":"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> be a polynomial function such that, for all real <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/0/9008820e6e82e992e4b49c305f53963e10c857b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x^2 + 1) = x^4 + 5x^2 + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"196\" height=\"19\" />.\nFor all real <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/5/3b50df6ce92b9a32613208f8992f8948c2db569d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, f(x^2-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"19\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/b/aab76767ab23663424772feb06f666181bb55540.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ x^4+5x^2+1\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ x^4+x^2-3\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ x^4-5x^2+1\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ x^4+x^2+3\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"776\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/5/34516e8f4909f440df1cdf468b7f635b018dd535.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x^2 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/e/91e23a347a0f557f7b197becb4b12cc9780a68b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 = y - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" />, so we can write the given equation as \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/a/faa881a8df41ea32218454631e6ac38b1c881e86.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}f(y) &amp;= x^4 + 5x^2 + 3 \\\\ &amp;= (x^2)^2 + 5x^2 + 3 \\\\ &amp;= (y - 1)^2 + 5(y - 1) + 3 \\\\ &amp;= y^2 - 2y + 1 + 5y - 5 + 3 \\\\ &amp;= y^2 + 3y - 1.\\end{align*}\" width=\"250\" height=\"129\" />\nThen substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/0/8506cdfc2f65bfb3e57e2e74ad11cde48c0ff863.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/4/4e448286c790e7ec79c871290f237ae0e129713e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}f(x^2 - 1) &amp;= (x^2 - 1)^2 + 3(x^2 - 1) - 1 \\\\ &amp;= x^4 - 2x^2 + 1 + 3x^2 - 3 - 1 \\\\ &amp;= x^4 + x^2 - 3.\\end{align*}\" width=\"307\" height=\"72\" />\nThe answer is therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/f/cbf4ec3b2ae89f4689eeabccb6c14b091e6fa72a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x^2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"55\" height=\"18\" /> We have that \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/2/8e2df2105de8e1b0754670a9fe8f7d1430fe53fe.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}f(x^2 + 1) &amp;= x^4 + 5x^2 + 3 \\\\ &amp;= y^2 + 5y + 3 \\\\ &amp;= y^2 + 5y + 4 - 1 \\\\ &amp;= (y+1)(y+4) -1 \\\\ &amp;= (x^2 + 1)(x^2 + 4) - 1\\end{align*}\" width=\"254\" height=\"128\" />\n</p><p>Thus, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/6/856d6b5f0539c768b94531110ed791c184a3dbc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n) = n(n+3)-1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"166\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>If we plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/3/d93d16e344873ce109d77fd69f82fd1511e2d721.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = x^2-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" /> we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/4/aa4526d9f3dab4fea1e41e108c742415cf1e7e57.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}f(x^2 - 1) &amp;= (x^2 -1)(x^2 + 2)-1 \\\\ &amp;= (x^4 + x^2 - 2) - 1 \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{x^4 + x^2 -3} \\end{align*}\" width=\"254\" height=\"83\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME\" title=\"1983 AHSME\">1983 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1983 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1983\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AM